    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_b_02_nerine_05",
      "hash64": "044D85FE8780EED8",
      "text": "如果穿過小磁怪的圓環，\\n限制時間就會延長。[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_b_02_nerine_06",
      "hash64": "044D88FE8780F3F1",
      "text": "納莉我建議[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳朝終點前進時，\\n盡可能地穿過圓環。[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
