      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_b_02_nerine_27",
      "hash64": "0446F7FE877B91E0",
      "text": "納莉我把它調合成\\n能增強飛行能力的藥丸。[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_b_02_nerine_28",
      "hash64": "044706FE877BAB5D",
      "text": "只有在挑戰時，\\n能在上空自由飛行。[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_b_02_nerine_29",
      "hash64": "044705FE877BA9AA",
      "text": "那麼，請開始挑戰。\\n……祝[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳好運。[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
