      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_b_02_nerine_19",
      "hash64": "044A7DFE877EAB69",
      "text": "我們再次更換地點。\\n……請一起來。[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_b_02_nerine_11",
      "hash64": "044A85FE877EB901",
      "text": "[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳的挑戰失敗了。\\c\\n無法守時的人，\\n是無法守住任何事物的。[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
